* MAINMENU.CMD
* Date ..... September 7, 1991
* Functin .. Main menu for hose record system
*
STORE ' ' TO MCHOICE
ERASE
@  1,20 SAY ' B E N T O N   F I R E   D E P A R T M E N T'
@  7,20 SAY '                Main Menu'
@ 10,30 SAY ' 1 -> Add New Hose Records'
@ 11,30 SAY ' 2 -> Edit Hose Records'
@ 12,30 SAY ' 3 -> Delete Hose Records'
@ 13,30 SAY ' 4 -> Reports'
@ 15,30 SAY ' 5 -> Quit'
@ 17,35 GET MCHOICE
READ
DO CASE
   CASE MCHOICE = '1'
      DO HOSEADD
   CASE MCHOICE = '2'
      DO HOSECHG
   CASE MCHOICE = '3'
      DO HOSEDEL
   CASE MCHOICE = '4'
      DO HOSERPT
ENDCASE
* eop: mainmenu.cmd
 eop: mainmenu.cmd
E C O R D'
@ 22,20 SAY ' by Curtis Williams -:- Benton IL 62812'
@ 23,1  SAY ' '
WAIT
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 